BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 195.97 Tm (Action: Publish one SPF record, a DKIM record from the mailbox provider, a DMARC record, and MX.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 180.75 Tm (Detail: In Google Admin go to Apps, Gmail, Authenticate email, generate a 2048-bit DKIM key, paste the) Tj ET
