BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 119.85 Tm (Title: Warm before the first cold send) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 104.62 Tm (Action: Turn on warmup for every inbox and let it ramp for 14 to 21 days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 89.40 Tm (Detail: Ramp two warmup emails per day up to a 30 cap, set the warmup reply rate between 65 and 95) Tj ET
