BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 589.77 Tm (Most self-inflicted losses come from touching the wrong field on a live listing. Steve Hunsaker warns never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 574.55 Tm (to edit the phone number or address once a profile is ranking, because the edit risks suspension on a page) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 559.32 Tm (he says prints leads and money, and his August to December 2025 numbers show 168 calls and 1,192) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 544.10 Tm (website clicks riding on it [PlZ43ZKMk34 @ 00:13:28]. Andy Walker names the phone number as the critical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 528.87 Tm (tripwire on multi-location builds: every added profile must carry a different number, call forwarding is fine, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 513.65 Tm (sharing the main line gets the main profile suspended, the one asset the whole quadrant play is built on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 498.42 Tm ([FcZZMpjLVNo @ 00:09:14]. ItsKeaton adds that bulk photo uploads risk a profile ban, a live hazard) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 483.20 Tm (because his $300 to $500 foot-in-the-door retainer targets profiles with few photos, dark images, missing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 467.97 Tm (hours and low reviews, so the pull is to dump an entire gallery on day one [d2krWJWz2iM @ 00:05:07].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 452.75 Tm (Surge Digital Marketing ties the same trap to paid spend: name, address or category edits trigger a 24 to 48) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 437.52 Tm (hour review that can pause the linked campaign, so the profile gets frozen during LSA migration week) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 422.30 Tm ([pZ9P9Hmof3g @ 00:10:54].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 407.07 Tm (LSA operators report traps that cost history and recourse rather than rankings. Surge Digital Marketing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 391.85 Tm (watched a client lose years of account history because a former agency held admin access, so step one is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 376.62 Tm (verifying which email owns the account; performance history also does not carry into the new Performance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 361.40 Tm (Max structure, which makes screenshots mandatory before the switch [pZ9P9Hmof3g @ 00:02:11]. Blended) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 346.17 Tm (targets are the second trap: a target CPL is an average, not a wall, and per-service targets get blended, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 330.95 Tm (services worth $500 and $15K must sit in separate campaigns [pZ9P9Hmof3g @ 00:04:14]. PushLeads) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 315.72 Tm (notes Google killed the lead dispute credit system in July 2024, leaving 'zero recourse' for mismatched) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 300.50 Tm (leads, which is why the primary category and description must repel bad-fit calls up front [vWdPlgxdJUA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 285.27 Tm (00:03:04]. Local View lists the quieter killers: expired background checks or licenses can drop or pause the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 270.05 Tm (ad, overextending into areas the business cannot serve backfires, and out-of-area calls should be marked) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 254.82 Tm ('not relevant' so targeting retrains instead of drifting [bzWbX2kyAhg @ 00:02:54].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 239.60 Tm (The headline math in Chapter Q9 needs a haircut before anyone builds a budget on it. Andy Walker's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 224.37 Tm (quadrant model turns $500 a month in rent into 30 leads, 10 closes at $1,000 and '$114,000' in annual profit,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 209.15 Tm (then says outright the number is not typical [FcZZMpjLVNo @ 00:06:53]. Steve Hunsaker's roughly $28K) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 193.92 Tm ('free advertising' figure for August to December 2025 rests on 168 calls valued at $100 each plus an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 178.70 Tm (assumed 10% conversion on 1,192 website clicks, and he expects minimal change in month one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 163.47 Tm ([PlZ43ZKMk34 @ 00:13:53]. His separate review math is the clearest bottleneck check: a verbal 'I'll review') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 148.25 Tm (converts at only 2 to 5%, so of 100 jobs with 40 willing reviewers, in-person asks alone capture 24,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 133.02 Tm (automation alone 16, and only both together reach all 40, a couple hundred reviews a year versus 50 to 70) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 117.80 Tm ([wdo4cRHVxXA @ 00:09:01]. TradeOps Consulting brings the same skepticism to paid search, where clicks) Tj ET
